      "quoteId": "2026-08-26: 'On August 26, 2026, we notified developers using whisper-1, gpt-4o-transcribe, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe, and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize of their deprecation and removal from the API on February 26, 2027.' (verified 2026-10-06)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": {
    "migration": "OpenAI removes these models from the API on 2027-02-26: whisper-1, gpt-4o-transcribe, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe, gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize. Calls that name them fail after that date. Recommended replacements: whisper-1 to gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe; gpt-4o-transcribe to gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe; gpt-4o-mini-transcribe to gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe; gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize to gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe. A newer model can answer differently, so test the switch rather than only renaming.",
    "edgeCases": [
      "A model name read from an environment variable, a config file or a variable set elsewhere is not found.",
      "A mocked API response that names the model, such as an msw or nock handler for the endpoint, is reported too.",
      "Azure OpenAI calls are reported too, though Azure names deployments its own way and sets its own retirement dates."
    ]
  },
